        <body>
            <div xml:id="d115-a5">

                <pb facs="0197" n="123" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg123"/>

                <head>[Enclosure E.—Telegram.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Presented at <placeName>Velletri</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-08">November 8, 1866</date>, 8.35
                        a. m.; arrived at Rome November 8, 1666, 8.50 a. m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>His Excellency the <hi rendition="#small-caps">General,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Arms, Rome :</hi></p>
                <p>I received the following telegram, dated 4.30 a. m., from Captain Zambilly :</p>
                <p>At the moment he left the prison, and while surrounded by six men as a guard,
                    Watson threw himself into the ravine, above a hundred feet perpendicular in
                    depth, which defends the prison. Fifty zouaves in pursuit of him.</p>
                <p>I will transmit to your excellency the intelligence I may receive by
                    telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ALLET, <hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant
                    Colonel.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
